      "text": "when the feed moves on.",
      "kind": "lyric_reference"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 93.75,
      "end": 97.101,
      "text": "Something that stays",
      "kind": "lyric_reference"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 97.101,
      "end": 103.005,
      "text": "when the feed moves on.",
      "kind": "lyric_reference"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 103.005,
      "end": 103.005,
      "text": "[Verse 2 \u2014 darker bass, distant metallic resonance]",
      "kind": "section_hint"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 103.005,
      "end": 106.436,
      "text": "Warpkeep\u2014Hyperion dreamed in stone,",
      "kind": "lyric_reference"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 106.436,
      "end": 110.66499999999999,
      "text": "the starways grown through root and rain.",
      "kind": "lyric_reference"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 110.66499999999999,
      "end": 114.176,
      "text": "A river threads a thousand doors;",
      "kind": "lyric_reference"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 114.176,
      "end": 117.686,
      "text": "the old tombs let tomorrow in.",
      "kind": "lyric_reference"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 117.686,
      "end": 119.202,
      "text": "The Core keeps dreaming underneath,",
      "kind": "lyric_reference"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 119.202,
      "end": 127.5,
      "text": "where no one hears the turning gears.",
      "kind": "lyric_reference"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 127.5,
      "end": 131.809,
      "text": "Above it, someone lights the forge.",
      "kind": "lyric_reference"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 131.809,
      "end": 136.277,
      "text": "Above it, someone's waiting here.",
      "kind": "lyric_reference"
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 136.277,
      "end": 136.277,
      "text": "[Pre-Chorus \u2014 tension rises without getting louder]",
      "kind": "section_hint"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 136.277,
      "end": 138.431,
      "text": "An empire is a distant thing.",
      "kind": "lyric_reference"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 138.431,
      "end": 140.585,
      "text": "The work is close enough to touch.",
      "kind": "lyric_reference"
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 140.585,
      "end": 142.66,
      "text": "You put another beam in place.",
      "kind": "lyric_reference"
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 142.66,
      "end": 146.09,
      "text": "For once, that feels like enough.",
      "kind": "lyric_reference"
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 146.09,
      "end": 146.09,
      "text": "[Chorus \u2014 fuller harmony]",
      "kind": "section_hint"
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
